{"id":"CYBrq0uIhBuLsRGX","meta":{"instanceId":"8443f10082278c46aa5cf3acf8ff0f70061a2c58bce76efac814b16290845177","templateCredsSetupCompleted":true},"name":"COD Order Confirmation & RTO Reducer – Shopify, WATI, AI Risk Score, Shiprocket & NDR","tags":[],"nodes":[{"id":"e9a4a4c8-b0ee-4a0c-9651-57dc2906c3b6","name":"Sticky Note – Overview","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[-1808,-800],"parameters":{"color":2,"width":1200,"height":708,"content":"## 📦 COD Order Confirmation & RTO Reducer (Shopify + WATI + Shiprocket)\n\nFor Indian D2C brands where a big share of COD orders come back as RTO, costing two-way shipping on parcels nobody wanted. Most of that is avoidable if you confirm the order and check the address before it ships.\n\n### How it works\nWhen a COD order lands in Shopify it's scored for RTO risk, using rules plus an AI check on the address and pincode, and the customer gets a WhatsApp asking them to confirm or cancel. Confirmed low-risk orders go straight to Shiprocket. Risky ones are held for a quick ops call and released or cancelled from a form. Unanswered orders get reminders and are auto-cancelled after 24 hours.\n\nAfter dispatch, courier updates trigger an out-for-delivery message, and failed deliveries (NDR) ask the customer what to do before re-attempting or escalating. Everything is tracked in one Google Sheet.\n\n### Setup steps\n1. Create a Google Sheet with a **COD Orders** tab.\n2. Connect Shopify, Google Sheets, OpenAI and Telegram credentials.\n3. Add WATI as Header Auth and Shiprocket API user login as Custom Auth (see the security note).\n4. Get the four WATI templates approved and fill in **Set Store Config**: shop domain, WATI endpoint, sheet ID, thresholds and webhook token.\n5. Point WATI and Shiprocket webhooks to **Receive WATI & Shiprocket Events**, place a test COD order, then activate."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"9a52fa2f-492e-41ce-9a78-8c49548606bf","name":"Sticky Note – Event Triggers","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[-432,-848],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":688,"height":1152,"content":"## 📥 Event Triggers\nFour ways in, one brain: new Shopify orders, customer replies and courier updates from webhooks, ops decisions from the review form, and a 15-minute schedule for follow-ups."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"09bcb25c-8e0e-49c7-8e43-ea479cfe4ed9","name":"Sticky Note – Load & Decide","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[288,-832],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":1024,"height":1136,"content":"## 🧭 Load & Decide\nLoads every tracked order and decides what each one needs right now: a confirmation, a reminder, a hold, a dispatch or an NDR follow-up. Rule-based risk signals are checked here first."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"9afdc994-ccef-4109-a56d-bc2a7191071b","name":"Sticky Note – AI Risk Score & Dispatch","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[1360,-832],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":1040,"height":1136,"content":"## 🧠 AI Risk Score & Dispatch\nNew COD orders get a 0–100 RTO risk score from GPT-4o-mini, which checks address quality and pincode/city mismatches. Every planned action is then split out and routed."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"c62a23c0-1880-4cac-8e0c-30df6a6b7cf3","name":"Sticky Note – Sheet Updates","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[2576,-1264],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":1456,"height":544,"content":"## 🗂️ Sheet Updates\nNew orders are added to the tracker, and every status change is written back so the next run knows exactly where each order stands."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"982a59bc-3c2e-4a42-ba41-77b3c83e5866","name":"Sticky Note – WhatsApp & Shopify Actions","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[2576,-592],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":1456,"height":544,"content":"## 💬 WhatsApp & Shopify Actions\nWATI sends the confirmation, reminder, out-for-delivery and failed-delivery templates. Shopify gets tags, notes and cancellations so your store always matches reality."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"d922e105-21f3-496b-806f-2dc1cd2a48f8","name":"Sticky Note – Shiprocket & Ops Alerts","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[2576,16],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":1488,"height":832,"content":"## 🚚 Shiprocket & Ops Alerts\nConfirmed orders are pushed to Shiprocket and NDRs are re-attempted, with the result saved to the sheet. Failed calls and orders that need a human ping the ops group on Telegram."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"dda826d5-30ee-43d3-8c38-f86bd88ab525","name":"Sticky Note – Credentials & Security","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[4096,512],"parameters":{"color":3,"width":480,"height":320,"content":"## 🔐 Credentials & Security\nShiprocket login lives in a Custom Auth credential, not the config node: `{\"body\":{\"email\":\"api-user@example.com\",\"password\":\"…\"}}`. Use a dedicated Shiprocket API user. Change `shiprocket_webhook_token` and keep all webhook URLs private."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"388df6b4-9351-4f73-a1fb-f65ee1de6545","name":"New Shopify Order","type":"n8n-nodes-base.shopifyTrigger","position":[-208,-592],"webhookId":"5b4662a4-1a31-46fb-8240-329cb9c862cb","parameters":{"topic":"orders/create","authentication":"accessToken"},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"2cbc21aa-76aa-478e-bc0d-dfa42c4a9fe4","name":"Receive WATI & Shiprocket Events","type":"n8n-nodes-base.webhook","position":[-208,-368],"webhookId":"40e11253-18a5-4aa8-b229-7744f46f8371","parameters":{"path":"cod-events","options":{},"httpMethod":"POST"},"typeVersion":2},{"id":"d40ac78c-59ed-493b-b37f-14ce02118323","name":"Ops Review Form (Held Orders)","type":"n8n-nodes-base.formTrigger","position":[-208,-144],"webhookId":"4d2b1309-f054-43d8-9feb-c08f7ebaee96","parameters":{"options":{"path":"cod-ops-review","appendAttribution":false},"formTitle":"Review Held COD Order","formFields":{"values":[{"fieldLabel":"Order Number","placeholder":"#1001","requiredField":true},{"fieldType":"dropdown","fieldLabel":"Decision","fieldOptions":{"values":[{"option":"Release to Shiprocket"},{"option":"Cancel Order"},{"option":"Keep On Hold"}]},"requiredField":true},{"fieldType":"textarea","fieldLabel":"Notes"}]},"formDescription":"Release a held order to Shiprocket or cancel it."},"typeVersion":2.2},{"id":"e81370b2-ceca-4875-81e8-9ed7083ea8e7","name":"Check Every 15 Minutes","type":"n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger","position":[-208,80],"parameters":{"rule":{"interval":[{"field":"minutes","minutesInterval":15}]}},"typeVersion":1.2},{"id":"5c268671-c2d5-4ceb-8f02-e93cae441931","name":"Set Store Config","type":"n8n-nodes-base.set","position":[368,-256],"parameters":{"options":{},"assignments":{"assignments":[{"id":"008af36a-4d2e-4295-9da8-343bdfc6a533","name":"store_name","type":"string","value":"Your Store"},{"id":"07926a8d-3d3e-4d3e-9642-2d75f21fe020","name":"country_code","type":"string","value":"91"},{"id":"c3744905-5284-4669-a152-b8518abde0a9","name":"shopify_shop","type":"string","value":"your-store.myshopify.com"},{"id":"8c54aa77-9416-487e-8c4e-af30468b741f","name":"shopify_api_version","type":"string","value":"2024-10"},{"id":"95a40711-0d69-4ef1-b2a0-aa4b16dc49ad","name":"wati_api_endpoint","type":"string","value":"https://live-mt-server.wati.io/YOUR_TENANT_ID"},{"id":"c24a5ceb-82d0-45d2-a9a3-a1821f07c760","name":"wati_broadcast_name","type":"string","value":"cod-automation"},{"id":"dec02d89-f47a-43d9-af7e-4906b8a04d9b","name":"wati_confirm_template","type":"string","value":"cod_order_confirmation"},{"id":"993e0c1e-843f-4cc5-a369-3ec31d02b65b","name":"wati_reminder_template","type":"string","value":"cod_confirmation_reminder"},{"id":"f6715074-059b-4d06-9310-2de622086cfe","name":"wati_ndr_template","type":"string","value":"ndr_delivery_failed"},{"id":"ea43f1cb-56ab-4f69-b81f-612cf00644dd","name":"wati_ofd_template","type":"string","value":"out_for_delivery_cod"},{"id":"db7d2041-4c4e-42fa-a13d-ef7a1ff5b47d","name":"ops_telegram_chat_id","type":"string","value":"YOUR_OPS_TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID"},{"id":"8c680b02-11cc-4b01-adc2-6cb455f1e36d","name":"sheet_id","type":"string","value":"YOUR_GOOGLE_SHEET_ID"},{"id":"57ad5f10-407e-40cc-ae5c-4df175ccedc1","name":"orders_sheet","type":"string","value":"COD Orders"},{"id":"201d777a-bee5-4592-b56d-48d1fe80b2a8","name":"shiprocket_pickup_location","type":"string","value":"Primary"},{"id":"a3060626-07cb-4e5d-a8e1-c305209fc63e","name":"shiprocket_webhook_token","type":"string","value":"CHANGE-ME-webhook-token"},{"id":"524ddddf-88be-4074-9f19-2959c47970ae","name":"default_weight_kg","type":"number","value":0.5},{"id":"5b51760d-ac37-4282-b959-e9cc9c81710d","name":"default_length_cm","type":"number","value":15},{"id":"29f98abd-1486-49ce-9f33-3ecc2ee31a30","name":"default_breadth_cm","type":"number","value":12},{"id":"429a767e-a091-402b-872c-05998bb79b3b","name":"default_height_cm","type":"number","value":8},{"id":"bd504c9b-f3cc-4a5a-a996-081fd5e87037","name":"average_order_value","type":"number","value":1200},{"id":"c5f80eda-5293-4ec7-91ca-b41e7b793e0c","name":"hold_threshold","type":"number","value":70},{"id":"68f0a58d-9595-49ae-96f8-44b3de0a5b27","name":"medium_threshold","type":"number","value":40},{"id":"3da3598f-f1fe-4d7e-94dd-28edb5821f7a","name":"high_risk_pincodes","type":"string","value":""},{"id":"53e9a5fd-0d11-4761-9d14-4535076cff03","name":"confirm_reminder_hours","type":"number","value":2},{"id":"a57f8b54-2e38-49fa-a32d-e528fcc54c23","name":"confirm_second_reminder_hours","type":"number","value":12},{"id":"2e855d20-c4b4-43c9-86ee-3ea342b57f4d","name":"auto_cancel_hours","type":"number","value":24},{"id":"a4ff38e3-ddbe-4137-98ed-3bea6103ea57","name":"ndr_reminder_hours","type":"number","value":12},{"id":"eb499d88-d367-4f9b-8259-d464c1fdd31a","name":"ndr_escalate_hours","type":"number","value":24},{"id":"dc815dc7-e7da-4e80-bb35-fdd172901c10","name":"ndr_auto_reattempt_hours","type":"number","value":36}]},"includeOtherFields":true},"typeVersion":3.4},{"id":"6cdb77be-900b-44f3-9ba8-e6663ee6f77e","name":"Get COD Orders Sheet","type":"n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets","position":[608,-256],"parameters":{"options":{},"sheetName":{"__rl":true,"mode":"name","value":"={{ $('Set Store Config').first().json.orders_sheet }}"},"documentId":{"__rl":true,"mode":"id","value":"={{ $('Set Store Config').first().json.sheet_id }}"}},"executeOnce":true,"typeVersion":4.5,"alwaysOutputData":true},{"id":"db4fc594-bb66-4e42-8529-e9e85be79dd1","name":"Decide Next Actions per Order","type":"n8n-nodes-base.code","position":[848,-256],"parameters":{"jsCode":"const esc = v => String(v ?? '').replace(/&/g, '&amp;').replace(/</g, '&lt;').replace(/>/g, '&gt;');\nconst phone10 = p => String(p ?? '').replace(/\\D/g, '').slice(-10);\nconst hoursSince = v => { const d = new Date(v); return isNaN(d) ? 0 : (Date.now() - d.getTime()) / 3600e3; };\nconst inr = v => '₹' + Number(v || 0).toLocaleString('en-IN', { maximumFractionDigits: 0 });\nconst mergeTags = (cur, add = []) => { const t = String(cur || '').split(',').map(x => x.trim()).filter(x => x && !/^(COD-|SR-|NDR$|RTO$|Delivered$)/.test(x)); add.forEach(a => { if (!t.includes(a)) t.push(a); }); return t.join(', '); };\nconst shopBase = s => `https://${String(s.shopify_shop).replace(/^https?:\\/\\//, '').replace(/\\/$/, '')}/admin/api/${s.shopify_api_version}`;\nconst watiBase = s => String(s.wati_api_endpoint).replace(/\\/$/, '');\n// ---- action builders (each becomes one item routed by \"Route by Action Type\") ----\nconst actTags = (s, r, add) => { const tags = mergeTags(r.shopify_tags, add); return { tags, act: { type: 'shopify', method: 'PUT', url: `${shopBase(s)}/orders/${r.order_id}.json`, body: { order: { id: Number(r.order_id), tags } } } }; };\nconst actCancel = (s, r, reason) => ({ type: 'shopify', method: 'POST', url: `${shopBase(s)}/orders/${r.order_id}/cancel.json`, body: { reason } });\nconst actTpl = (s, phone, tpl, params) => ({ type: 'wati', url: `${watiBase(s)}/api/v1/sendTemplateMessage?whatsappNumber=${s.country_code}${phone10(phone)}`,\n  body: { template_name: tpl, broadcast_name: `${s.wati_broadcast_name}-${Date.now()}`, parameters: params.map((v, i) => ({ name: String(i + 1), value: String(v ?? '').replace(/[\\n\\t]+/g, ' ').slice(0, 500) || '-' })) } });\nconst actText = (s, phone, text) => ({ type: 'wati', url: `${watiBase(s)}/api/v1/sendSessionMessage/${s.country_code}${phone10(phone)}?messageText=${encodeURIComponent(text)}`, body: {} });\nconst actUpdate = update => ({ type: 'update', update });\nconst actTg = text => ({ type: 'telegram', text });\nconst actNdr = (r, action, comments) => r.awb ? ({ type: 'shiprocket', purpose: 'ndr', path: `/ndr/${r.awb}/action`, body: { action, comments }, order: r }) : null;\nconst itemsShort = r => { try { return JSON.parse(r.items_json || '[]').map(i => `${i.name} x${i.units}`).join(', ').slice(0, 120); } catch (e) { return ''; } };\n\n// One brain for every event: Shopify order · WATI reply · courier tracking · ops form · 15-min schedule\nconst s = $('Set Store Config').first().json;\nconst rows = $('Get COD Orders Sheet').all().map(i => i.json).filter(r => r.order_id);\nconst body = (s.body && typeof s.body === 'object') ? s.body : null;\nconst src = body || s;\nconst out = [];\nconst emit = (...acts) => { const a = acts.flat().filter(Boolean); if (a.length) out.push({ json: { needs_ai: false, actions: a } }); };\nconst now = new Date().toISOString();\n\n// ---------- 1. NEW SHOPIFY ORDER ----------\nif (src.line_items && src.id) {\n  const o = src;\n  if (rows.some(r => String(r.order_id) === String(o.id))) return []; // webhook retry\n  const ship = o.shipping_address || o.billing_address || {};\n  const gw = `${(o.payment_gateway_names || []).join(' ')} ${o.gateway || ''}`;\n  const isCOD = /cod|cash on delivery|cash/i.test(gw);\n  const name = ship.name || `${ship.first_name || ''} ${ship.last_name || ''}`.trim() || 'Customer';\n  const items = o.line_items.map((li, i) => ({ name: `${li.title}${li.variant_title ? ' - ' + li.variant_title : ''}`, sku: li.sku || String(li.variant_id || `SKU-${i + 1}`),\n    units: Number(li.quantity) || 1, selling_price: Number(li.price) || 0, discount: Math.round((Number(li.total_discount) || 0) / (Number(li.quantity) || 1) * 100) / 100 }));\n  const ord = { order_id: String(o.id), order_name: String(o.name || o.id), created_at: o.created_at || now, customer_name: name,\n    phone: phone10(ship.phone || o.phone || o.customer?.phone), email: String(o.email || o.customer?.email || '').toLowerCase(),\n    payment_type: isCOD ? 'COD' : 'Prepaid', order_value: Number(o.total_price) || 0, currency: o.currency || 'INR', items_json: JSON.stringify(items),\n    weight_kg: Number(o.total_weight) ? Math.max(0.1, Number(o.total_weight) / 1000) : Number(s.default_weight_kg),\n    address1: String(ship.address1 || ''), address2: String(ship.address2 || ''), city: String(ship.city || ''), state: String(ship.province || ''),\n    pincode: String(ship.zip || '').replace(/\\s/g, ''), shopify_tags: String(o.tags || '') };\n  // Rule-based RTO / fraud signals\n  const sig = [], add = (p, why) => sig.push({ points: p, why });\n  const addr = `${ord.address1} ${ord.address2}`.trim();\n  if (o.customer?.orders_count !== undefined && Number(o.customer.orders_count) <= 1) add(10, 'First-time customer');\n  if (ord.order_value > 5000) add(15, `High order value ${inr(ord.order_value)}`);\n  else if (ord.order_value > 2 * Number(s.average_order_value || 1200)) add(8, `Order value ${inr(ord.order_value)} > 2x AOV`);\n  if (addr.length < 15) add(15, 'Very short address');\n  if (!/\\d/.test(addr)) add(10, 'No house / flat number');\n  if (!/^[1-9]\\d{5}$/.test(ord.pincode)) add(25, `Invalid pincode \"${ord.pincode}\"`);\n  if (String(s.high_risk_pincodes || '').split(/[,\\s]+/).includes(ord.pincode)) add(20, `Pincode ${ord.pincode} on high-RTO list`);\n  if (!/^[6-9]\\d{9}$/.test(ord.phone)) add(25, 'Invalid Indian mobile number');\n  else if (/(\\d)\\1{5,}/.test(ord.phone) || /0123456|1234567|9876543/.test(ord.phone)) add(15, 'Suspicious phone pattern');\n  if (name.length < 3 || /\\d/.test(name) || /(.)\\1{3,}/i.test(name) || /^(test|abc|xyz|asdf|qwerty)/i.test(name)) add(10, 'Name looks fake');\n  if (/@(mailinator|tempmail|10minutemail|guerrillamail|yopmail|trashmail|getnada)\\./i.test(ord.email)) add(10, 'Disposable email');\n  if (items.some(i => i.units >= 3)) add(10, '3+ units of one item');\n  const hr = new Date(new Date(ord.created_at).getTime() + 5.5 * 3600e3).getUTCHours();\n  if (hr < 5) add(5, 'Placed between 12–5 AM');\n  const same = rows.filter(r => ord.phone && phone10(r.phone) === ord.phone);\n  const h = { rto: same.filter(r => /^RTO/.test(r.status)).length, cancelled: same.filter(r => r.status === 'Cancelled').length,\n              delivered: same.filter(r => r.status === 'Delivered').length, openRecent: same.filter(r => !/Delivered|Cancelled|RTO/.test(r.status) && hoursSince(r.created_at) < 24).length };\n  if (h.rto) add(Math.min(40, h.rto * 25), `${h.rto} past RTO(s) on this phone`);\n  if (h.cancelled) add(Math.min(15, h.cancelled * 8), `${h.cancelled} past cancellation(s)`);\n  if (h.openRecent) add(10, `${h.openRecent} other open order(s) in last 24h`);\n  if (h.delivered) add(-Math.min(20, h.delivered * 10), `${h.delivered} past delivered order(s)`);\n  const ruleScore = Math.max(0, Math.min(100, sig.reduce((a, b) => a + b.points, 0)));\n  return [{ json: { needs_ai: true, order: ord, rule_score: ruleScore, signals: sig, history: h,\n    ai_prompt: `Order ${ord.order_name} | ${ord.payment_type} | ${ord.order_value} ${ord.currency}\\nCustomer: ${name} | Phone: ${ord.phone} | Email: ${ord.email || 'none'} | Previous orders: ${o.customer?.orders_count ?? 'unknown'}\\nAddress: ${addr}, ${ord.city}, ${ord.state} - ${ord.pincode}\\nItems: ${items.map(i => `${i.name} x${i.units} @${i.selling_price}`).join('; ')}\\nNote: ${o.note || 'none'}\\nPhone history: ${JSON.stringify(h)}\\nRule signals (score ${ruleScore}): ${sig.map(x => `${x.why} (${x.points})`).join('; ') || 'none'}` } }];\n}\n\n// ---------- 2. WATI CUSTOMER REPLY ----------\nif (body && (body.waId || body.eventType)) {\n  if (body.owner === true || (body.eventType && body.eventType !== 'message')) return [];\n  const text = String(body.buttonReply?.text || body.interactiveButtonReply?.title || body.listReply?.title || body.text || '').trim();\n  const p10 = phone10(body.waId);\n  const r = rows.filter(x => phone10(x.phone) === p10 && ['Awaiting Confirmation', 'NDR Pending'].includes(x.status))\n                .sort((a, b) => new Date(b.last_event_at) - new Date(a.last_event_at))[0];\n  if (!r || !text) return [];\n  const t = text.toLowerCase(), first = String(r.customer_name).split(' ')[0];\n  const no = /\\b(cancel|no|nahi|nahin|nhi|mat|dont|don't|reject)\\b|❌|^2$/.test(t);\n  const yes = !no && /\\b(confirm|confirmed|yes|y|haan|han|ha|ji|ok|okay|sure|reattempt|re-attempt|deliver)\\b|✅|👍|^1$/.test(t);\n  const u = { order_id: r.order_id, customer_response: text.slice(0, 200), responded_at: now, last_event_at: now };\n  if (r.status === 'Awaiting Confirmation') {\n    if (yes) {\n      const held = r.risk_band === 'High', tg = actTags(s, r, [`COD-Risk-${r.risk_band}`, held ? 'COD-OnHold' : 'COD-Confirmed']);\n      Object.assign(u, { status: held ? 'On Hold - Review' : 'Ready to Ship', hold_reason: held ? 'High risk - confirmed, needs ops release' : '', shopify_tags: tg.tags });\n      emit(actUpdate(u), tg.act, actText(s, r.phone, held ? `Thank you ${first}! Your order ${r.order_name} is confirmed ✅. We'll verify a couple of details and ship it shortly.`\n        : `Thank you ${first}! Your order ${r.order_name} is confirmed ✅ and will ship soon. Please keep ${inr(r.order_value)} ready at delivery.`),\n        held ? actTg(`🟠 <b>High-risk order confirmed</b> ${esc(r.order_name)} (score ${esc(r.risk_score)})\\n${esc(r.customer_name)} · +91 ${esc(r.phone)} · ${inr(r.order_value)}\\nRelease or cancel it via the ops form.`) : null);\n    } else if (no) {\n      const tg = actTags(s, r, [`COD-Risk-${r.risk_band}`, 'COD-Cancelled']);\n      Object.assign(u, { status: 'Cancelled', hold_reason: 'Cancelled by customer on WhatsApp', shopify_tags: tg.tags });\n      emit(actUpdate(u), tg.act, actCancel(s, r, 'customer'), actText(s, r.phone, `Okay ${first}, order ${r.order_name} has been cancelled. Hope to serve you again! 🙏`));\n    } else emit(actUpdate(u), actText(s, r.phone, `Hi ${first}, please reply *YES* to confirm order ${r.order_name} (${inr(r.order_value)}) or *NO* to cancel it.`));\n  } else if (no) {\n    const tg = actTags(s, r, [`COD-Risk-${r.risk_band}`, 'SR-Pushed', 'RTO']);\n    Object.assign(u, { status: 'RTO Requested', hold_reason: 'Customer declined after failed delivery', shopify_tags: tg.tags });\n    emit(actUpdate(u), tg.act, actNdr(r, 'return', `Customer declined on WhatsApp: ${text.slice(0, 150)}`), actText(s, r.phone, `Understood ${first}. We've cancelled delivery of order ${r.order_name}.`),\n      actTg(`↩️ <b>Customer declined re-delivery</b> ${esc(r.order_name)} · AWB ${esc(r.awb)}\\n\"${esc(text.slice(0, 200))}\"`));\n  } else {\n    u.status = 'NDR Reattempt Requested';\n    emit(actUpdate(u), actNdr(r, 're-attempt', `Customer confirmed on WhatsApp: ${text.slice(0, 150)}`),\n      actText(s, r.phone, `Thanks ${first}! We've asked ${r.courier || 'the courier'} to re-attempt delivery of order ${r.order_name}. Please keep your phone reachable${r.payment_type === 'COD' ? ` and ${inr(r.order_value)} ready` : ''}.`));\n  }\n  return out;\n}\n\n// ---------- 3. COURIER TRACKING (Shiprocket webhook) ----------\nif (body && (body.awb || body.current_status || body.awb_code)) {\n  if (s.shiprocket_webhook_token && String((s.headers || {})['x-api-key'] || '') !== String(s.shiprocket_webhook_token)) return [];\n  const awb = String(body.awb || body.awb_code || ''), cid = String(body.order_id || '').replace('#', ''), sr = String(body.sr_order_id || '');\n  const r = rows.find(x => (awb && x.awb === awb) || (cid && String(x.order_name).replace('#', '') === cid) || (sr && x.shiprocket_order_id === sr));\n  if (!r) return [];\n  const st = String(body.current_status || body.shipment_status || '').toUpperCase();\n  const scans = Array.isArray(body.scans) ? body.scans : [], last = scans[scans.length - 1] || {};\n  const first = String(r.customer_name).split(' ')[0];\n  const u = { order_id: r.order_id, awb: awb || r.awb, courier: String(body.courier_name || r.courier || ''), shipment_status: st, last_event_at: now };\n  const acts = [];\n  let tagAdd = null;\n  if (/RTO/.test(st) && /DELIVER/.test(st)) { u.status = 'RTO Delivered'; tagAdd = 'RTO'; }\n  else if (/RTO/.test(st)) { u.status = 'RTO Initiated'; tagAdd = 'RTO';\n    if (!/^RTO/.test(r.status)) acts.push(actTg(`↩️ <b>RTO initiated</b> ${esc(r.order_name)} · ${esc(u.courier)} · AWB ${esc(u.awb)}\\n${esc(r.customer_name)} · ${esc(r.city)} ${esc(r.pincode)} · ${inr(r.order_value)} · NDRs ${esc(r.ndr_count || 0)} · risk ${esc(r.risk_band)}`)); }\n  else if (/UNDELIVERED|NDR|FAILED/.test(st)) {\n    if (!(r.status === 'NDR Pending' && hoursSince(r.ndr_sent_at) < 6)) {\n      const n = (Number(r.ndr_count) || 0) + 1, reason = String(body.ndr_reason || last.activity || 'Delivery attempt failed').slice(0, 120);\n      Object.assign(u, { status: 'NDR Pending', ndr_count: n, ndr_reason: reason, ndr_sent_at: now, ndr_reminders: 0 }); tagAdd = 'NDR';\n      acts.push(actTpl(s, r.phone, s.wati_ndr_template, [first, r.order_name, reason, u.courier || 'our courier', inr(r.order_value)]));\n      if (n >= 2) acts.push(actTg(`⚠️ <b>NDR #${n}</b> ${esc(r.order_name)} · ${esc(reason)}\\n${esc(r.customer_name)} +91 ${esc(r.phone)} · AWB ${esc(u.awb)} · ${inr(r.order_value)}\\nHigh RTO risk, consider calling.`));\n    }\n  } else if (/OUT FOR DELIVERY/.test(st)) {\n    if (r.status !== 'Out for Delivery') { u.status = 'Out for Delivery';\n      if (r.payment_type === 'COD') acts.push(actTpl(s, r.phone, s.wati_ofd_template, [first, r.order_name, inr(r.order_value), u.courier || 'our courier'])); }\n  } else if (/^DELIVERED/.test(st)) { u.status = 'Delivered'; tagAdd = 'Delivered'; }\n  else if (['Shipped', 'In Transit', 'NDR Reattempt Requested'].includes(r.status)) u.status = 'In Transit';\n  if (tagAdd) { const tg = actTags(s, r, [`COD-Risk-${r.risk_band}`, 'SR-Pushed', tagAdd]); u.shopify_tags = tg.tags; acts.push(tg.act); }\n  emit(actUpdate(u), acts);\n  return out;\n}\n\n// ---------- 4. OPS REVIEW FORM ----------\nif (s['Decision']) {\n  const num = String(s['Order Number'] || '').replace(/[#\\s]/g, ''), d = s['Decision'], notes = String(s['Notes'] || '');\n  const r = rows.find(x => String(x.order_name).replace('#', '') === num);\n  if (!r) { emit(actTg(`⚠️ Ops review: order #${esc(num)} not found`)); return out; }\n  if (/Shipped|Transit|Delivery|Delivered|RTO|NDR/.test(r.status)) { emit(actTg(`⚠️ Ops review: ${esc(r.order_name)} is already \"${esc(r.status)}\", so no change was made.`)); return out; }\n  const u = { order_id: r.order_id, last_event_at: now, notes: `${r.notes || ''} | ops ${now.slice(0, 10)}: ${d}${notes ? ' - ' + notes : ''}`.slice(-400) };\n  const acts = [actTg(`🧑‍💼 <b>Ops decision</b> ${esc(r.order_name)}: <b>${esc(d)}</b>${notes ? '\\n📝 ' + esc(notes) : ''}`)];\n  if (d === 'Release to Shiprocket') { const tg = actTags(s, r, [`COD-Risk-${r.risk_band}`, 'COD-Confirmed']); Object.assign(u, { status: 'Ready to Ship', hold_reason: '', shopify_tags: tg.tags }); acts.push(tg.act); }\n  if (d === 'Cancel Order') { const tg = actTags(s, r, [`COD-Risk-${r.risk_band}`, 'COD-Cancelled']); Object.assign(u, { status: 'Cancelled', hold_reason: `Ops cancelled: ${notes || 'high risk'}`, shopify_tags: tg.tags }); acts.push(tg.act, actCancel(s, r, 'fraud')); }\n  emit(actUpdate(u), acts);\n  return out;\n}\n\n// ---------- 5. SCHEDULED RUN: dispatch + follow-ups ----------\nconst istHour = new Date(Date.now() + 5.5 * 3600e3).getUTCHours();\nconst daytime = istHour >= 9 && istHour < 21;\nfor (const r of rows) {\n  const first = String(r.customer_name).split(' ')[0];\n  if (r.status === 'Ready to Ship') {\n    let items = []; try { items = JSON.parse(r.items_json || '[]'); } catch (e) {}\n    const parts = String(r.customer_name).trim().split(/\\s+/);\n    const sub = items.reduce((a, x) => a + (Number(x.selling_price) - Number(x.discount || 0)) * Number(x.units), 0) || Number(r.order_value);\n    emit(actUpdate({ order_id: r.order_id, status: 'Dispatching', last_event_at: now }), { type: 'shiprocket', purpose: 'create', path: '/orders/create/adhoc', order: r, body: {\n      order_id: String(r.order_name).replace('#', ''), order_date: new Date(new Date(r.created_at).getTime() + 5.5 * 3600e3).toISOString().slice(0, 16).replace('T', ' '),\n      pickup_location: s.shiprocket_pickup_location, comment: `${r.payment_type} | risk ${r.risk_band} (${r.risk_score})`,\n      billing_customer_name: parts[0] || 'Customer', billing_last_name: parts.slice(1).join(' ') || '.', billing_address: r.address1 || r.address2,\n      billing_address_2: r.address2, billing_city: r.city, billing_pincode: r.pincode, billing_state: r.state, billing_country: 'India',\n      billing_email: r.email || '', billing_phone: phone10(r.phone), shipping_is_billing: true,\n      order_items: items.map((x, k) => ({ name: x.name, sku: x.sku || `SKU-${k + 1}`, units: Number(x.units) || 1, selling_price: Number(x.selling_price) || 0, discount: Number(x.discount) || 0 })),\n      payment_method: r.payment_type === 'COD' ? 'COD' : 'Prepaid', sub_total: Math.round(sub * 100) / 100,\n      length: Number(s.default_length_cm), breadth: Number(s.default_breadth_cm), height: Number(s.default_height_cm), weight: Number(r.weight_kg) || Number(s.default_weight_kg) } });\n  } else if (r.status === 'Awaiting Confirmation') {\n    const h = hoursSince(r.confirm_sent_at || r.created_at), n = Number(r.confirm_reminders) || 0;\n    if (h >= Number(s.auto_cancel_hours)) {\n      const tg = actTags(s, r, [`COD-Risk-${r.risk_band}`, 'COD-Cancelled']);\n      emit(actUpdate({ order_id: r.order_id, status: 'Cancelled', hold_reason: `No confirmation in ${s.auto_cancel_hours}h`, shopify_tags: tg.tags, last_event_at: now }),\n        tg.act, actCancel(s, r, 'declined'), actTg(`⌛ <b>Auto-cancelled</b> ${esc(r.order_name)}: no confirmation in ${s.auto_cancel_hours}h (${inr(r.order_value)}, risk ${esc(r.risk_band)})`));\n    } else if (daytime && ((n === 0 && h >= Number(s.confirm_reminder_hours)) || (n === 1 && h >= Number(s.confirm_second_reminder_hours)))) {\n      emit(actUpdate({ order_id: r.order_id, confirm_reminders: n + 1, last_event_at: now }),\n        actTpl(s, r.phone, s.wati_reminder_template, [first, s.store_name, r.order_name, inr(r.order_value), itemsShort(r), `${r.address1}, ${r.city} ${r.pincode}`.slice(0, 120)]));\n    }\n  } else if (r.status === 'NDR Pending') {\n    const h = hoursSince(r.ndr_sent_at || r.last_event_at), n = Number(r.ndr_reminders) || 0;\n    const ndrMsg = () => actTpl(s, r.phone, s.wati_ndr_template, [first, r.order_name, r.ndr_reason || 'delivery attempt failed', r.courier || 'our courier', inr(r.order_value)]);\n    if (h >= Number(s.ndr_auto_reattempt_hours) && r.awb) {\n      emit(actUpdate({ order_id: r.order_id, status: 'NDR Reattempt Requested', last_event_at: now }), actNdr(r, 're-attempt', 'Auto re-attempt: no customer reply on WhatsApp'),\n        actTg(`🔁 <b>Auto re-attempt requested</b> ${esc(r.order_name)} · AWB ${esc(r.awb)} · no reply in ${s.ndr_auto_reattempt_hours}h`));\n    } else if (daytime && h >= Number(s.ndr_escalate_hours) && n < 2) {\n      emit(actUpdate({ order_id: r.order_id, ndr_reminders: 2, last_event_at: now }), ndrMsg(),\n        actTg(`📞 <b>NDR needs a call</b> ${esc(r.order_name)} · ${esc(r.customer_name)} +91 ${esc(r.phone)}\\n${esc(r.ndr_reason)} · ${esc(r.courier)} · AWB ${esc(r.awb)} · ${inr(r.order_value)}`));\n    } else if (daytime && h >= Number(s.ndr_reminder_hours) && n < 1) {\n      emit(actUpdate({ order_id: r.order_id, ndr_reminders: 1, last_event_at: now }), ndrMsg());\n    }\n  }\n}\nreturn out;"},"typeVersion":2},{"id":"0fbcd136-0f55-4313-883e-4c971c617cbe","name":"Needs AI Score?","type":"n8n-nodes-base.if","position":[1088,-256],"parameters":{"options":{},"conditions":{"options":{"version":2,"leftValue":"","caseSensitive":true,"typeValidation":"loose"},"combinator":"and","conditions":[{"id":"69d5be7f-0573-4d7f-854d-6d0ef2b31cd4","operator":{"type":"boolean","operation":"true","singleValue":true},"leftValue":"={{ $json.needs_ai }}","rightValue":""}]}},"typeVersion":2.2},{"id":"6b62f94b-5f0d-49ef-b7e3-3ad7bfe45505","name":"AI Assess RTO Risk","type":"@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.openAi","position":[1504,-480],"parameters":{"modelId":{"__rl":true,"mode":"list","value":"gpt-4o-mini","cachedResultName":"GPT-4O-MINI"},"options":{"temperature":0.2},"messages":{"values":[{"role":"system","content":"You are an RTO and COD-fraud analyst for an Indian D2C e-commerce brand. Assess the probability that this order will be refused, undeliverable or fraudulent.\nReturn ONLY JSON: {\"risk_score\": integer 0-100, \"risk_band\": \"low\"|\"medium\"|\"high\", \"top_reasons\": [up to 3 short strings], \"address_quality\": \"good\"|\"ok\"|\"poor\", \"address_issues\": [short strings], \"suggested_action\": \"confirm\"|\"confirm_and_verify_address\"|\"hold_for_call\"}\nIndian addresses normally have a house/flat number, building or street, locality and a landmark. Check that city and state plausibly match the pincode region (first digit: 1 Delhi/HR/PB/HP/JK, 2 UP/UK, 3 RJ/GJ, 4 MH/MP/CG/GA, 5 AP/TS/KA, 6 TN/KL, 7 WB/OD/NE, 8 BR/JH). Gibberish names, test orders, a city mismatch, high-value COD from first-time buyers and past RTOs are strong signals. Prepaid orders carry far less RTO risk. Be calibrated: most genuine orders should score below 35. Add judgement rather than repeating the rule signals."},{"content":"={{ $json.ai_prompt }}"}]},"jsonOutput":true},"typeVersion":1.8},{"id":"673bcd56-9665-4d20-9d17-e794da919b97","name":"Apply AI Risk Score","type":"n8n-nodes-base.code","position":[1840,-480],"parameters":{"jsCode":"const esc = v => String(v ?? '').replace(/&/g, '&amp;').replace(/</g, '&lt;').replace(/>/g, '&gt;');\nconst phone10 = p => String(p ?? '').replace(/\\D/g, '').slice(-10);\nconst hoursSince = v => { const d = new Date(v); return isNaN(d) ? 0 : (Date.now() - d.getTime()) / 3600e3; };\nconst inr = v => '₹' + Number(v || 0).toLocaleString('en-IN', { maximumFractionDigits: 0 });\nconst mergeTags = (cur, add = []) => { const t = String(cur || '').split(',').map(x => x.trim()).filter(x => x && !/^(COD-|SR-|NDR$|RTO$|Delivered$)/.test(x)); add.forEach(a => { if (!t.includes(a)) t.push(a); }); return t.join(', '); };\nconst shopBase = s => `https://${String(s.shopify_shop).replace(/^https?:\\/\\//, '').replace(/\\/$/, '')}/admin/api/${s.shopify_api_version}`;\nconst watiBase = s => String(s.wati_api_endpoint).replace(/\\/$/, '');\n// ---- action builders (each becomes one item routed by \"Route by Action Type\") ----\nconst actTags = (s, r, add) => { const tags = mergeTags(r.shopify_tags, add); return { tags, act: { type: 'shopify', method: 'PUT', url: `${shopBase(s)}/orders/${r.order_id}.json`, body: { order: { id: Number(r.order_id), tags } } } }; };\nconst actCancel = (s, r, reason) => ({ type: 'shopify', method: 'POST', url: `${shopBase(s)}/orders/${r.order_id}/cancel.json`, body: { reason } });\nconst actTpl = (s, phone, tpl, params) => ({ type: 'wati', url: `${watiBase(s)}/api/v1/sendTemplateMessage?whatsappNumber=${s.country_code}${phone10(phone)}`,\n  body: { template_name: tpl, broadcast_name: `${s.wati_broadcast_name}-${Date.now()}`, parameters: params.map((v, i) => ({ name: String(i + 1), value: String(v ?? '').replace(/[\\n\\t]+/g, ' ').slice(0, 500) || '-' })) } });\nconst actText = (s, phone, text) => ({ type: 'wati', url: `${watiBase(s)}/api/v1/sendSessionMessage/${s.country_code}${phone10(phone)}?messageText=${encodeURIComponent(text)}`, body: {} });\nconst actUpdate = update => ({ type: 'update', update });\nconst actTg = text => ({ type: 'telegram', text });\nconst actNdr = (r, action, comments) => r.awb ? ({ type: 'shiprocket', purpose: 'ndr', path: `/ndr/${r.awb}/action`, body: { action, comments }, order: r }) : null;\nconst itemsShort = r => { try { return JSON.parse(r.items_json || '[]').map(i => `${i.name} x${i.units}`).join(', ').slice(0, 120); } catch (e) { return ''; } };\n\n// Blend rule score (60%) with GPT score (40%) and create the new-order actions\nconst s = $('Set Store Config').first().json;\nconst ctx = $('Needs AI Score?').all(0);\nconst cols = [\"order_id\", \"order_name\", \"created_at\", \"customer_name\", \"phone\", \"email\", \"payment_type\", \"order_value\", \"currency\", \"items_json\", \"weight_kg\", \"address1\", \"address2\", \"city\", \"state\", \"pincode\", \"shopify_tags\", \"risk_score\", \"risk_band\", \"risk_reasons\", \"ai_address_issues\", \"status\", \"confirm_sent_at\", \"confirm_reminders\", \"customer_response\", \"responded_at\", \"hold_reason\", \"shiprocket_order_id\", \"shipment_id\", \"awb\", \"courier\", \"shipment_status\", \"ndr_count\", \"ndr_reason\", \"ndr_sent_at\", \"ndr_reminders\", \"last_event_at\", \"notes\"];\nconst holdT = Number(s.hold_threshold) || 70, medT = Number(s.medium_threshold) || 40;\nreturn $input.all().map((item, i) => {\n  const c = ctx[i].json, o = c.order;\n  let a = item.json.message?.content ?? item.json.content ?? {};\n  if (typeof a === 'string') { try { a = JSON.parse(a.replace(/```json|```/g, '').trim()); } catch (e) { a = {}; } }\n  const ai = Number.isFinite(Number(a.risk_score)) ? Number(a.risk_score) : c.rule_score;\n  let score = Math.round(0.6 * c.rule_score + 0.4 * ai);\n  if (c.history.rto >= 2) score = Math.max(score, 80);\n  if (a.suggested_action === 'hold_for_call') score = Math.max(score, holdT);\n  score = Math.min(100, score);\n  const band = score >= holdT ? 'High' : score >= medT ? 'Medium' : 'Low';\n  const reasons = [...c.signals.filter(x => x.points > 0).sort((x, y) => y.points - x.points).map(x => x.why), ...(a.top_reasons || [])].slice(0, 5);\n  const cod = o.payment_type === 'COD', now = new Date().toISOString();\n  const tg = actTags(s, o, [`COD-Risk-${band}`, cod ? 'COD-Awaiting' : (band === 'High' ? 'COD-OnHold' : 'COD-Confirmed')]);\n  const r = { ...o, shopify_tags: tg.tags, risk_score: score, risk_band: band, risk_reasons: reasons.join(' | '), ai_address_issues: (a.address_issues || []).join(', '),\n    status: cod ? 'Awaiting Confirmation' : band === 'High' ? 'On Hold - Review' : 'Ready to Ship', confirm_sent_at: cod ? now : '', confirm_reminders: 0,\n    hold_reason: !cod && band === 'High' ? 'High fraud risk (prepaid)' : '', ndr_count: 0, ndr_reminders: 0, last_event_at: now,\n    notes: `AI: ${a.address_quality || 'n/a'} address, ${a.suggested_action || 'n/a'}` };\n  const row = {}; cols.forEach(k => row[k] = r[k] ?? '');\n  const shortAddr = `${o.address1}, ${o.city} ${o.pincode}`.slice(0, 120);\n  const acts = [{ type: 'append', row }, tg.act];\n  if (cod) acts.push(actTpl(s, o.phone, s.wati_confirm_template, [o.customer_name.split(' ')[0], s.store_name, o.order_name, inr(o.order_value), itemsShort(o), shortAddr]));\n  if (band === 'High') acts.push(actTg([`🚩 <b>High-risk ${esc(o.payment_type)} order ${esc(o.order_name)}</b> · score <b>${score}</b>/100`,\n    `${esc(o.customer_name)} · +91 ${esc(o.phone)} · ${inr(o.order_value)}`, `📍 ${esc(shortAddr)}`, '', ...reasons.map(x => `• ${esc(x)}`),\n    a.address_issues?.length ? `🏠 ${esc(a.address_issues.join(', '))}` : null, '',\n    cod ? 'Confirmation sent. The order stays <b>on hold</b> after confirmation until you release it in the ops form.' : 'Prepaid order held for review.'].filter(x => x !== null).join('\\n')));\n  return { json: { needs_ai: false, actions: acts }, pairedItem: { item: i } };\n});"},"typeVersion":2},{"id":"94d03a12-231d-45cd-a300-af8202cc6796","name":"Split Into Actions","type":"n8n-nodes-base.code","position":[2000,-240],"parameters":{"jsCode":"// One item per action, so the Switch can route each to the right API\nconst out = [];\nfor (const item of $input.all()) for (const a of (item.json.actions || [])) out.push({ json: a });\nreturn out;"},"typeVersion":2},{"id":"f9c16114-722c-4105-852f-75d402b7bd22","name":"Route by Action Type","type":"n8n-nodes-base.switch","position":[2224,-256],"parameters":{"rules":{"values":[{"outputKey":"Append Row","conditions":{"options":{"version":2,"leftValue":"","caseSensitive":true,"typeValidation":"strict"},"combinator":"and","conditions":[{"id":"70aeaa03-3d1d-4a91-b481-3affa6017224","operator":{"type":"string","operation":"equals"},"leftValue":"={{ $json.type }}","rightValue":"append"}]},"renameOutput":true},{"outputKey":"Update Row","conditions":{"options":{"version":2,"leftValue":"","caseSensitive":true,"typeValidation":"strict"},"combinator":"and","conditions":[{"id":"ba11342a-8abc-4540-a621-38a3ee780e85","operator":{"type":"string","operation":"equals"},"leftValue":"={{ $json.type }}","rightValue":"update"}]},"renameOutput":true},{"outputKey":"WhatsApp","conditions":{"options":{"version":2,"leftValue":"","caseSensitive":true,"typeValidation":"strict"},"combinator":"and","conditions":[{"id":"0c1ef401-50aa-4eb3-b890-b1c3df3a1839","operator":{"type":"string","operation":"equals"},"leftValue":"={{ $json.type }}","rightValue":"wati"}]},"renameOutput":true},{"outputKey":"Shopify","conditions":{"options":{"version":2,"leftValue":"","caseSensitive":true,"typeValidation":"strict"},"combinator":"and","conditions":[{"id":"83ad2344-b0d9-4146-8729-523b1b5f9512","operator":{"type":"string","operation":"equals"},"leftValue":"={{ $json.type }}","rightValue":"shopify"}]},"renameOutput":true},{"outputKey":"Shiprocket","conditions":{"options":{"version":2,"leftValue":"","caseSensitive":true,"typeValidation":"strict"},"combinator":"and","conditions":[{"id":"bd7c5de6-5fa8-4507-9617-d69d446369b2","operator":{"type":"string","operation":"equals"},"leftValue":"